nt":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yTJ2Ir6CMBzThLK5dmACvQ","review_id":"UIj9NeuKtJ7wV4b4CClZQw","date":"2016-08-09T16:30:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.932304859161377,"text_excerpt":"I had been wanting to try this place for a long time. After taking my cousin to Parkway for lunch while he was in town for a convention, he said he wanted to get coffee after. I immediately thought of this place nearby. He checked the Yelp reviews and said it looked good, so off we went. Parking was a little tough, but we managed. They are located in a cool building over near Jesuit. Everything is monkey themed. It was all really fun and cute. The menu offered a nice variety of drinks and food. We had just eaten, so we stuck to drinks. The cashier/barista was really nice. I can't recall his name, but he had blue hair. He gave us a sample of their Granita as my cousin was curious about it...."},{"business_id":"yTJ2Ir6CMBzThLK5dmACvQ","review_id":"RiqpVXp5yuM1Xf7-1pMhBA","date":"2015-08-06T02:44:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9194990396499634,"text_excerpt":"Cute spot in Mid-City. It's really bright and airy, which is refreshing for coffee shops in NOLA. I came here to get some work done on a Wednesday morning and it was fairly crowded. I had a soy cappuccino. It was decent, but not particularly strong. They have a lot of pastries and yogurt parfaits, as well as sandwiches. Service was great; the workers are very friendly and earnest. Wifi was also very good and bathrooms are clean. It'd be nice if they had more outlets available near the tables. Also, there's no background music playing, but if a lot of conversations are going on at the same time, it can get pretty loud."},{"business_id":"yTJ2Ir6CMBzThLK5dmACvQ","review_id":"QS94eqBkXEz7V_GPJpOAtw","date":"2018-02-14T15:59:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9151903390884399,"text_excerpt":"The chai latte with almond milk is my favorite (and actually the only thing I've ever purchased lol). Thanks to Groupon, I've found this great coffee/tea shop! FYI, there is only street parking and I always have trouble finding a parking spot. but the place is also a great spot to work and study. The WiFi is steady and it's never too crowded."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yTJ2Ir6CMBzThLK5dmACvQ","photo_id":"BKyqTBnc1MgNhwZ7g5XofQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BKyqTBnc1MgNhwZ7g5XofQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9003400802612305},{"business_id":"yTJ2Ir6CMBzThLK5dmACvQ","photo_id":"Eja8Z7aY3PEGH4s-k4F_hw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Eja8Z7aY3PEGH4s-k4F_hw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8639211654663086},{"business_id":"yTJ2Ir6CMBzThLK5dmACvQ","photo_id":"9fF0Q4_z2pwfZUEV5THkMA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/9fF0Q4_z2pwfZUEV5THkMA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8603297472000122},{"business_id":"yTJ2Ir6CMBzThLK5dmACvQ","photo_id":"0aMj5snimnZwisBEmjG06w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/0aMj5snimnZwisBEmjG06w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8352287411689758}]},"notebook_case":null}
